\lim_{h \to 0} \dfrac{\dfrac{3}{x+h} - \dfrac{3}{x}}{h} =\lim_{h \to 0}- \dfrac{3}{x^2 + hx} = -\dfrac{3}{x^2}
\end{equation*} 
